-->

  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>ET_SunDrop</defName>
    <label>Sundrop</label>
    <description>A sphere infused with golden energy directly from the sun. Despite the source of it's power, it is only warm to the touch.\n\nCan be used to revitialize the life force of certain Terraweapons, increasing the time before they wither away.</description>
    <possessionCount>10</possessionCount>
    <tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Resource/SunDrop</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>0.85</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <stackLimit>150</stackLimit>
    <healthAffectsPrice>false</healthAffectsPrice>
    <intricate>true</intricate>    <!-- Not returned to player when product made of this is smelted. -->
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>50</MaxHitPoints>
      <MarketValue>5.5</MarketValue>
      <Mass>0.015</Mass>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
      <DeteriorationRate>0</DeteriorationRate>
    </statBases>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>Manufactured</li>
    </thingCategories>
    <comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_Glower">
        <glowRadius>6.9</glowRadius>
        <glowColor>(370,370,370,0)</glowColor>
      </li>
      <li Class="CompProperties_HeatPusher">
        <compClass>CompHeatPusherPowered</compClass>
        <heatPerSecond>0.5</heatPerSecond>
        <heatPushMaxTemperature>12</heatPushMaxTemperature>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <allowedArchonexusCount>100</allowedArchonexusCount>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>ET_Deepsap</defName>
    <label>Deepsap</label>
    <description>A jar of refined, potent terrasap, named due to it's secretive point of origin. Deepsap is required for more advanced and complex procedures involving Terratech, and is a very valuable resource to colonies that know how to utilize it.
\n\nLike glowsap and brightsap, deepsap is not directly infused into other Terratech. Instead, it is used as a catalyst, nutrient source, and a long-term mutagen. Structures that utilize Deepsap will generally have "Deeproot" in their name.
\n\nUse cases:
Upgrading structures to lithoid (crystal-based) variants
Creating lithoid and hybrid weaponry
Accessing Bioquartz
Upgrading to Tier 3 (Deeproot) Conduit Trees</description>
    <tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Resource/Deepsap</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_StackCount</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>0.8</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <stackLimit>6</stackLimit>
    <healthAffectsPrice>false</healthAffectsPrice>
    <intricate>true</intricate>    <!-- Not returned to player when product made of this is smelted. -->
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>75</MaxHitPoints>
      <MarketValue>154</MarketValue>
      <Mass>0.05</Mass>
      <Flammability>1</Flammability>
      <DeteriorationRate>0.25</DeteriorationRate>
    </statBases>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>ResourcesRaw</li>
    </thingCategories>
